	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Alseerr

Search and request media from your Seerr instance, directly from Alfred.

### Setup

1. Set your **Seerr URL** (e.g. https://seerr.example.com)
2. Set your **Seerr API Key** (found in Seerr Settings General)
3. Optionally set a **Shortcut Keyword** (e.g. `sr`) in addition to `alseerr`
4. Optionally adjust the **Timeout** (default: 5000ms)

### Usage

- Type `alseerr {query}` (or your shortcut keyword) to search for movies and TV shows
- Press **Enter** to open the item in Seerr web UI
- Press **Alt+Enter** to request the item
- Press **Cmd+C** to copy the Seerr URL
- Press **Cmd+L** for full details in Large Type

### Status Icons

- Not yet requested
- Pending approval
- Processing / downloading
- Partially available
- Available</string>
